================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
================================================================================

The lexicon is derived from a digitised Tigrinya--English dictionary, which
remains subject to its own terms; the licences above cover this repository's
compilation, correction and annotation of that material, not the underlying
dictionary. Anyone redistributing the lexicon should check the source's terms
independently.

Model outputs in results/ were generated by third-party checkpoints, each
governed by its own licence (Gemma Terms of Use, Apache 2.0, and others).
They are released here as experimental records under CC BY 4.0; the licences
of the models that produced them are unaffected.

paper/acl.sty and paper/acl_natbib.bst are the official ACL style files,
redistributed under their own terms from github.com/acl-org/acl-style-files.
